  "description": "Ground AI answers in application-managed documents with loading, splitting, embeddings, hybrid retrieval, reranking and metadata filters. Provides RAG and Agentic RAG tools, streaming runs, cooperative cancellation and supported reasoning/search forwarding. Includes Perplexity standard embeddings and separate contextualized document-group APIs with explicit binary-vector results. Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 4.0.0 and Mythosia.AI.Rag.Abstractions 6.2.0; no dependency on the full Mythosia.AI implementation.",
  "id": "Mythosia.AI.Rag",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-13T03:54:48.013Z",
