  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.0.0 aligns RAG with Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 4.0.0 while retaining the independent retrieval architecture and Mythosia.AI.Rag.Abstractions 6.2.0 contract. Completion propagates CancellationToken through retrieval, rewriting and the inner service; Agentic RAG forwards the tool token into retrieval and reports search failures as failed tool results. RAG runs expose AIRunResult: use (await run.Result).Text for the answer or inspect the inner model usage, citations, model, rounds and finish details without a stream reader. Retrieval/embedding usage is separate. Rebuild callers for the changed completion/Run contracts; ordinary RAG completion remains a string API. Adds Perplexity standard 0.6B/4B embeddings, contextualized document-group APIs and explicit packed binary vectors. Use Mythosia.AI 8.0.0 for its new provider controls when choosing the inner service. Migration: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/docs/v8-migration.md Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v800",
